OL,3,A'Everlasting legacy' - Taylor Swift and
OL,4,ABeyonce lead tributes to Dolly Parton
OL,5,Aafter she dies aged 80
OL,6,
OL,7,FLegendary country music singer Dolly
OL,8,FParton has died at the age of 80
OL,10,F"Dolly Parton's legacy is one of love,
OL,11,Fcompassion, and resilience," her team
OL,12,Fsays - read their statement in full
OL,14,FRepresentatives later revealed that
OL,15,FParton had died after "bravely facing a
OL,16,Fbrief battle with cancer"
OL,18,FThe country icon sold more than 100
OL,19,Fmillion records worldwide, and wrote
OL,20,Fover 3,000 songs in a career that
OL,21,Fspanned six decades
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
