OL,3,A'Everlasting legacy' - Taylor Swift and
OL,4,ABeyonce lead tributes to Dolly Parton
OL,5,Aafter she dies aged 80
OL,6,
OL,7,FParton also devoted decades of her life
OL,8,Fto charitable causes, particularly
OL,9,Fchild literacy and education
OL,11,FBeyonce says Parton was "the north
OL,12,Fstar" and "one of one", Sir Paul
OL,13,FMcCartney says it's "hard to imagine" a
OL,14,Fworld without Dolly, Oprah says "we are
OL,15,Fall better because she was here"
OL,17,FRaised in poverty in a one-room cabin
OL,18,Fin the Smoky Mountains of Tennessee,
OL,19,FParton was the fourth youngest of 12
OL,20,Fchildren - her early life in pictures
